{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alborada is a tiny game with small objectives. Plant a forest, get familiar with flora &amp; fauna,\u00a0or just listen to hours and hours of original nature sound recordings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/f5095110bd21a5bb041cf3415c7fdacc.poster.avif?t=1760384544\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/f5095110bd21a5bb041cf3415c7fdacc.webm?t=1760384544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/f5095110bd21a5bb041cf3415c7fdacc.mp4?t=1760384544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/16bef6ae8bf543d8219450918efde1d7.avif?t=1760384544\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your forest by resolving simple puzzles, finding hidden items, or building your collections to unlock new plants and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/691c88d9308a597c606f71eb15c7d1d3.poster.avif?t=1760384544\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/691c88d9308a597c606f71eb15c7d1d3.webm?t=1760384544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/691c88d9308a597c606f71eb15c7d1d3.mp4?t=1760384544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98a437de248f7819e26e12cc434189b9.avif?t=1760384544\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax by interacting with the environment; play with the time and weather to adjust your ideal atmosphere to focus on your tasks, or just relax and meditate with the sounds of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.poster.avif?t=1760384544\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.webm?t=1760384544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/98c000be69e3c632ae7891b50b236c32.mp4?t=1760384544\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566370/extras/a85d87fb681dc3f0a22ba24775d9db7f.avif?t=1760384544\" width=1280 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Field recording library:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The field recording library is an ongoing project of sound recordings from the different parts of the Iberian Peninsula. Enjoy the meadows, forests, lakes, rivers, and other natural sounds anywhere you go by using the app in Audio Player mode to roam freely through the library or Game Mode to create a perfect mix of sounds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alborada is a cross-platform idle game &amp; audio player that runs on Linux, Windows and Android devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2566370?t=1760384544","ba